{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102010637154-1102_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261102012919\"/><p>阿曼蘇丹海賽姆開始訪華。</p><p>阿曼蘇丹海賽姆周日（1日）抵達北京，開始對中國進行為期兩天的國事訪問。</p><p>此次訪問是海賽姆蘇丹繼任以來首次訪華，也是中國阿曼兩國建交48年來阿曼國家元首首次訪華。中國外交部發言人日前表示，中方願同阿方一道以此訪為契機，推動兩國戰略夥伴關係取得更大進展。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:44.405463+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T17:06:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T02:58:32.181971+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:48.892276+00:00","content_hash":"de5dbc427d75176bae6c4f07cf3c4e75c091739752c064902a97a953a52a1869","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}